<h1>Careers at Meridian Castings</h1>

<p>Around 860 people work across our three sites, in roles ranging from foundry and machine shop operations to quality, engineering, finance and supply chain. Many of our current supervisors and managers started as apprentices, and we recruit apprentices most years at both the Sheffield and Wrexham sites.</p>

<p>Benefits vary slightly by site and contract, but typically include a company pension, private healthcare after a qualifying period, and support for relevant professional qualifications. Shift patterns in the foundries and machine shops are published a month in advance, with overtime paid at a set premium rate.</p>

